{"id":"minimum-window-substring","title":"Minimum window substring","difficulty":"hard","pattern":"sliding window","statement":"<p>Return the shortest substring of <code>s</code> that contains every character of <code>t</code> (with multiplicity), or \"\" if none exists. The answer is unique when it exists.</p><p>Constraints: up to 10\u2075 characters.</p>","entry":{"python":"min_window","cpp":{"name":"minWindow","ret":"string","params":[["string","s"],["string","t"]]}},"kind":"function","compare":"exact","time_limit_ms":2000,"hints":["Expand right until the window is valid; then shrink left while it stays valid.","Track how many required characters are still missing, so validity is O(1) to check."],"complexity":"O(|s| + |t|) time","starter":{"python":"def min_window(s, t):\n    pass\n","cpp":"string minWindow(string s, string t) {\n    \n}\n"},"tests":[{"args":["ADOBECODEBANC","ABC"],"expected":"BANC","sample":true},{"args":["a","a"],"expected":"a","sample":true},{"args":["a","aa"],"expected":""},{"args":["ab","b"],"expected":"b"},{"args":["bba","ab"],"expected":"ba"},{"args":["","GFEDCBAAG"],"expected":"GADGABECF"}],"solution":{"explanation":"<p>Count what t needs. Extend the right edge, decrementing a 'missing' counter when a needed character arrives. Once nothing is missing, advance the left edge past characters that are surplus (need &lt; 0), record the window, then drop one needed character to look for the next. Each pointer moves at most |s| times.</p>","python":"import collections\n\ndef min_window(s, t):\n    if not t: return \"\"\n    need = collections.Counter(t); missing = len(t)\n    left = 0; best = (float(\"inf\"), 0, 0)\n    for right, c in enumerate(s, 1):\n        if need[c] > 0: missing -= 1\n        need[c] -= 1\n        if missing == 0:\n            while need[s[left]] < 0:\n                need[s[left]] += 1; left += 1\n            if right - left < best[0]: best = (right - left, left, right)\n            need[s[left]] += 1; missing += 1; left += 1\n    return \"\" if best[0] == float(\"inf\") else s[best[1]:best[2]]\n","cpp":"string minWindow(string s, string t) {\n    vector<int> need(128, 0); for (char c : t) need[c]++;\n    int missing = t.size(), left = 0, bl = 0, blen = INT_MAX;\n    for (int r = 0; r < (int)s.size(); r++) {\n        if (need[s[r]]-- > 0) missing--;\n        if (missing == 0) {\n            while (need[s[left]] < 0) need[s[left++]]++;\n            if (r - left + 1 < blen) { blen = r - left + 1; bl = left; }\n            need[s[left++]]++; missing++;\n        }\n    }\n    return blen == INT_MAX ? \"\" : s.substr(bl, blen);\n}\n"}}